flowchart TD
    Probe[Probe / Answer / Workflow / Review]
    Prediction[Predicted Confidence + Posture]
    Outcome[Observed Outcome]
    Event[SelfRegulationOutcomeRecord]
    Calib[Calibration Event]
    Aggregate[Calibration Aggregate]
    Drift{Calibration Drift?}
    Pattern{Failure Pattern?}
    Profile[Profile Update Proposal]
    Review[Human/Policy Review]
    NewVersion[New Calibration/Self-Model Version]
    Regress[Regression Test]
    Replay[Replay / Probing Drill]

    Probe --> Prediction
    Prediction --> Outcome
    Outcome --> Event
    Event --> Calib
    Calib --> Aggregate
    Aggregate --> Drift
    Event --> Pattern
    Drift -->|yes| Profile
    Pattern -->|yes| Regress
    Pattern -->|yes| Replay
    Profile --> Review
    Review -->|approved| NewVersion
    Review -->|rejected| Replay
